<%- include('partials/header') %>

<%- include("partials/breadcrumbs", {breadcrumbs: [{label:'Home',url:'/'},{label:'Service Areas'}]}) %>

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-bg" style="background-image:url('<%= site.symptomsHeroImage %>')"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Service Areas — Salt Lake Valley Auto Repair</h1>
    <p>Conveniently located in South Salt Lake, Scott's Auto and Clutch serves drivers throughout the Salt Lake Valley. Find your community below.</p>
    <div class="hero-buttons">
      <a href="tel:<%= site.phoneTel %>" class="btn btn-primary">Call <%= site.phone %></a>
      <a href="sms:<%= site.phoneSms %>" class="btn btn-secondary">Text Us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="content-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="locations-grid">
      <% allLocations.forEach(l => { %>
      <a href="/locations/<%= l.slug %>" class="location-card">
        <h2><%= l.name %>, UT</h2>
        <p><%= l.isHome ? 'Our Location' : l.distance + ' (' + l.driveTime + ' drive)' %></p>
        <span class="card-link">View Details</span>
      </a>
      <% }) %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="content-section bg-light">
  <div class="container content-narrow">
    <h2>One Shop, Central Location</h2>
    <p>Scott's Auto and Clutch has operated from the same address on Crystal Ave in South Salt Lake since 1990. That central location puts us within a short drive of most Salt Lake Valley neighborhoods — and right on the TRAX Green Line for customers who prefer to drop off their vehicle and take transit home.</p>
    <p>We work on every make and model: domestic, import, and European. Whether you're coming from Sugar House or Sandy, you get the same mechanic, the same honest diagnosis, and the same quality of work.</p>
    <h2>Drop-Off Service — No Need to Wait</h2>
    <p>Most customers drop their vehicle off in the morning and pick it up by end of day. We'll call or text you once we've had a look, explain what we found, and give you a firm estimate before any work begins. There are no surprise charges at pickup.</p>
    <h2>Free Estimates for Valley Drivers</h2>
    <p>If you're not sure whether a repair is worth it, bring the vehicle by. We'll diagnose the problem and give you an honest answer about what it will cost — no obligation to proceed. We'd rather earn your trust with a straight answer than push you into a repair you don't need.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/cta') %>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
